        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ellis Ferreira, Rick Leach, Corina Morariu, Boris Becker, Galbraith\n- Events: 2000 Australian Open, 2001 Australian Open, 1997 Stockholm Open – Doubles, Olympic Games\n- Topics: Grand Slam doubles titles, year-end championships, Masters Series titles, world No. 1 rankings\n\nFacts:\n- Ellis Ferreira won the men's doubles title at the 2000 Australian Open with Rick Leach.\n- Ellis Ferreira won the mixed doubles title at the 2001 Australian Open with Corina Morariu.\n- Ellis Ferreira won 2 Grand Slam doubles titles in total.\n- In the 1997 Stockholm Open doubles event, Galbraith partnered Ellis Ferreira and lost in the final.\n- Boris Becker was born on 22 November 1967.\n- Boris Becker is a German former professional tennis player who reached world No. 1.\n- Boris Becker won five year-end championships, 13 Masters Series titles, and an Olympic gold medal in doubles.",
